<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11275" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάλαμνος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[πᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάλαμος</span> (cf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαμναῖος</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλάμη, νώνυμνος</span> from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νώνυμος</span>), properly, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without hands,</i> i.e. <i>helpless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὴρ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.597
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				53
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀ. λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alc.
					49
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AB</u>
					418
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in Lyr. and
			Eleg., <i>reckless, lawless,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φρένες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					2.57
				</span></i>
			; of acts, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρδειν ἔργ᾽ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					28.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάλαμνα μυθεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					481
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνελέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					281
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι παθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					598
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
